/* A mono-pitch roof slab over the first floor: four vertices, eaves at 3 m along the model's X axis, ridge 6 m away and 3.464 m higher (30 degrees), facing the model's -Y. */
#80=IFCSLAB('3Rf0Sl1Ab2Cd3Ef4Gh5Ij6',$,'Roof',$,$,#81,#84,$,.ROOF.);
